{"fixe-r1/PL12·1b": {"raw": "<lines>\n「住店。」你应了一声，往柜台走。\n艾琳娜跟进来半肩，没急着关门，先回头看了一眼街上的雾。\n米拉把杯子放下，眼睛在你们俩身上各停了一停。\n「通铺三金一晚，一人一份。单间八金，只剩一间。」\n她抬手往楼梯下指了指，那边堂里摆着几张草铺，靠炉子最近的两张还空着。\n「炉子夜里不熄。热水算在房钱里。」\n艾琳娜看着那几张草铺，没有先开口。\n</lines>\n<ops>\nmove player T001/inn\nmove elena T001/inn\n</ops>\n<options>\n「两份通铺。」\n@米拉 问她最近镇上有没有生人来过\n@米拉 问雾里失踪那件事\n「我付单间的钱，她睡堂里。」\n</options>", "ttft": 1.5084974590572529, "s": 3.3475405840435997, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7356, "completion_tokens": 224, "total_tokens": 7580, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1152}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 34}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 1152, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 6204}, "extra": {}}, "fixe-r1/PL12·2b": {"raw": "<vars>\nplayer.gold = 12\nplayer.silver = 3\nplayer.copper = 9\n</vars>\n<files>\n无变化\n</files>", "ttft": 1.2181149999960326, "s": 1.3410289580351673, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7226, "completion_tokens": 37, "total_tokens": 7263, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 3200}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3200, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4026}, "extra": {}}, "fixe-r1/PL12·4b": {"raw": "<vars>\nlocation = T001/inn\n</vars>\n<files>\n无变化\n</files>", "ttft": 1.4263271660311148, "s": 3.5909895410295576, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7315, "completion_tokens": 440, "total_tokens": 7755, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 3200}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 417}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3200, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4115}, "extra": {}}, "fixe-r1/PL12·7b": {"raw": "<vars>\ntime.day = 2\ntime.clock = \"05:30\"\n</vars>\n<files>\nmove elena T001/shop_general\n</files>", "ttft": 1.1488458329695277, "s": 5.600821832951624, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7304, "completion_tokens": 781, "total_tokens": 8085, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 3200}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 743}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3200, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4104}, "extra": {}}, "fixe-r1/PL12·8b": {"raw": "<vars>\ntime.clock = \"08:45\"\n</vars>\n<files>\n[~write lore/notes_mossbarrow_road.md]# 苔墓小径 · 老苇的话\n\n- 第 1 天上午,在 T001/shop_general 向老苇打听苔墓小径。\n- 老苇:苔墓那条小径近来走的人少;公会的人去过两趟,只回来一个,其余没影了。\n- 老苇不愿多说,把话压低,末尾带警告的意思,货价一分不让。\n- 艾琳娜挑了两支火把与一捆麻绳搁在柜台上,价八金,尚未付账。\n- 与委托 T001/Q001 雾中失踪者可能相关。\n[/write]\n</files>", "ttft": 1.538572582998313, "s": 7.45673325000098, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7494, "completion_tokens": 1150, "total_tokens": 8644, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 3328}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 980}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3328, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4166}, "extra": {}}, "fixe-r2/PL12·2b": {"raw": "<vars>\ntime.day = 2\ntime.clock = \"07:00\"\nplayer.gold = 15\n</vars>\n<files>\nmove elena T001/inn\n</files>", "ttft": 1.077362458978314, "s": 6.699462791963015, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7207, "completion_tokens": 1127, "total_tokens": 8334, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 6016}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1084}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 6016, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1191}, "extra": {}}, "fixe-r2/PL12·3b": {"raw": "<vars>\ntime.clock = \"08:45\"\n</vars>\n<files>\nmove elena T001/inn\nmove rowan T004/guild\n</files>", "ttft": 1.2858378330129199, "s": 4.276089790975675, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7291, "completion_tokens": 583, "total_tokens": 7874, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 5504}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 545}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 5504, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1787}, "extra": {}}, "fixd-r1/PL12·3b": {"raw": "<vars>\nlocation = T001/inn\nplayer.gold = 15\n</vars>\n<files>\n</files>", "ttft": 1.1280776669736952, "s": 2.75875866698334, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7436, "completion_tokens": 306, "total_tokens": 7742, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 6144}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 279}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 6144, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1292}, "extra": {}}, "fixd-r2/PL12·2b